WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,400
Hole A in the community still controls a room.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,800
One month per control

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,600
It's equivalent to me earning millions less, right?

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:23,860
It would be bad to invite another landlord to live here.

5
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,260
Brother Yuan is here again

6
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:27,060
This ironworking machine is ready for good things

7
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:28,460
I have to find a way to hide.
